.TH VOLTBILL 1 "September 2026" "VoltBill 2.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
voltbill \- high-performance utility distribution & grid analytics engine in native C
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B voltbill
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.br
.B voltbill
\fICOMMAND\fR [\fIARGS...\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B VoltBill
is an enterprise-grade utility distribution engine and customer management system written in native ISO C.
Engineered under strict systems programming invariants, VoltBill combines a 24-bit TrueColor cyber-aesthetic TUI,
multi-tier progressive slab billing, solar rooftop net-metering, industrial power factor regulation,
Time-of-Day (ToD) peak-hour tariffs, defaulter notice automation, grid-wide batch billing, and scriptable CLI subcommands.
.PP
VoltBill operates with deterministic sub-microsecond calculation latency and a constant memory footprint of < 1.9 MB RSS,
providing zero dynamic heap churn on transaction-critical execution paths.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-\-demo ", " \-\-seed
Seed realistic consumer and billing records and launch interactive dashboard.
.TP
.BR \-\-export
Export all consumer registries and billing records to CSV spreadsheets.
.TP
.BR \-\-backup
Create an atomic, timestamped JSON snapshot of all system data.
.TP
.BR \-\-batch
Execute batch billing run across all active grid nodes.
.TP
.BR \-v ", " \-\-version
Display version and lead architect information.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Display usage information and exit.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.BI bill " <consumer_id> <reading>"
Generate invoice directly from the terminal for the given consumer ID and current meter reading.
.TP
.BI pay " <consumer_id> <amount> [mode]"
Process payment for the given consumer ID. Mode: 0=Cash, 1=UPI, 2=Card, 3=NetBank.
.TP
.BI status " <consumer_id>"
Display instant account balance, arrears, and meter status.
.TP
.BI calc " <units> [category] [solar_export]"
Run instant tariff simulation. Category: 0=Domestic, 1=Commercial, 2=Industrial, 3=Agricultural.
.TP
.BI qr " <payload>"
Synthesize and display a full-screen, high-contrast, phone-scannable ISO/IEC 18004 QR code matrix.
.TP
.BR scada ", " grid
Launch real-time SCADA primary substation grid telemetry monitor.
.TP
.BI ufls " [frequency] [rocof]"
Simulate automated high-speed Under-Frequency Load Shedding (UFLS) defense engine.
.TP
.BI modbus " [hex_pdu]"
Inspect, parse, and validate industrial Modbus RTU telemetry frames with hardware CRC-16 polynomial checks.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I data/customers.dat
Binary datastore of registered consumers with CRC-32 integrity header.
.TP
.I data/bills.dat
Binary datastore of finalized billing records.
.TP
.I data/payments.dat
Binary datastore of payment transaction ledger.
.TP
.I config/tariffs.cfg
Runtime tariff rate configuration file.
